1043
00:54:02,039 --> 00:54:02,360
zaten.

1044
00:54:02,539 --> 00:54:03,460
Yani tam olarak

1045
00:54:03,460 --> 00:54:04,159
toparlarsak

1046
00:54:04,159 --> 00:54:04,440
böyle.

1047
00:54:05,760 --> 00:54:06,260
Ondan sonra

1048
00:54:06,260 --> 00:54:06,659
yine bakın

1049
00:54:06,659 --> 00:54:07,579
yıl 1932

1050
